  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Shadow_Fade_Desperado.jpg\" title=\"Shadow Fade Desperado\"><img alt=\"Shadow Fade Desperado\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"300\" src=\"/images/Shadow_Fade_Desperado.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Shadow_Fade_Desperado.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Shadow Fade Desperado</div></div></div>\n<p>These gun-toting skeletons fire their laser-like weapons tick away the health of their targets.  Although the damage is relatively little, there are generally several found at once!\n</p><p><b>Race:</b> Fade\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Ranger\n</p><p><b>Tip:</b> <i>They like to spread out around you.  Shadow Lightning is one of the best ways to deal with them. Also, they are just like the <a href=\"/wiki/Fade_Banshee\" title=\"Fade Banshee\">Fade Banshee</a> and like to run away to a safe range distance and attack. An <a href=\"/wiki/AoE_Mage\" title=\"AoE Mage\">AoE Mage</a> shouldn't have a problem racking in the XP with these guys.</i>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shadow Fade Desperado!\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror-Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror-Dome\">Abyss Milll</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror-Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror-Dome\">Grave Forge</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Plague_Plant\" title=\"Plague Plant\">Plague Plant</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Frosty Devastator!\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Burrow\" title=\"Balzack's Burrow\">Balzack's Burrow</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Mania\" title=\"Mutant Mania\">Mutant Mania</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Poison Devastator!\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Divine Devastator!\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest\" title=\"The Widower's Nest\">The Widower's Nest</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ember Devastator!\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest\" title=\"The Widower's Nest\">The Widower's Nest</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ebon Devastator!\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Contaminated Devastator!\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/HDoL\" title=\"HDoL\">HDoL</a>\n</td></tr></table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
